{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.BetaReceptivity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.BetaReceptivity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.HeckeH3","lean:module:QOU.Interactions.BorromeanUnique"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean3_alt_char","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean3_alt_char","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BetaReceptivity.lean#L87-L103","doc":"χ_alt(B₃) = 1 EXACTLY for all q.\n\nSame argument: χ_alt(σ₀σ₁⁻¹) = 1 (proved above).\nχ_alt(B₃) = 1³ = 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean3_net_exact","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean3_net_exact","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BetaReceptivity.lean#L73-L85","doc":"net(B₃) = χ_triv(B₃) = 1 EXACTLY for all q.\n\nProof: χ_triv is multiplicative on the group algebra.\nχ_triv(σ₀σ₁⁻¹) = 1 (proved above).\nχ_triv(B₃) = χ_triv((σ₀σ₁⁻¹)³) = 1³ = 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean_unit_alt_char","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean_unit_alt_char","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BetaReceptivity.lean#L57-L69","doc":"In the ALTERNATING representation: σ₀ ↦ −q⁻¹, σ₁⁻¹ ↦ −q.\n(σ₁ ↦ −q⁻¹, and σ₁⁻¹ = σ₁ − HA ↦ −q⁻¹ − (q−q⁻¹) = −q.)\nTherefore σ₀σ₁⁻¹ ↦ (−q⁻¹)(−q) = 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean_unit_trivial_char","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean_unit_trivial_char","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BetaReceptivity.lean#L45-L55","doc":"In the TRIVIAL representation: σ₀ ↦ q, σ₁⁻¹ ↦ q⁻¹.\nTherefore σ₀σ₁⁻¹ ↦ q·q⁻¹ = 1.\n\nThis is a computation in R_t (scalars), not in 2×2 matrices. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.two_crossing_ud1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.two_crossing_ud1","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BetaReceptivity.lean#L39-L41","doc":"2× up-down crossing at gen 1: 2·C_ud₁ = 2σ₁ − HA·I. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.two_crossing_ud0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.two_crossing_ud0","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BetaReceptivity.lean#L34-L37","doc":"2× up-down crossing at gen 0: 2·C_ud₀ = 2σ₀ − HA·I.\n(Avoiding ½ to stay in ℤ[t,t⁻¹].) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.crossing_dd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.crossing_dd","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BetaReceptivity.lean#L30-L32","doc":"The down-down crossing: C_dd = σ₁ − HA·I (Hecke inverse). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.crossing_uu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.crossing_uu","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BetaReceptivity.lean#L27-L28","doc":"The up-up crossing at generator 0: C_uu = σ₀. ","signatureChunk":0}]}